---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-24 text-center" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <!-- Heading Utama -->
  <h1 id="hero-heading" class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-tight">
    Perbaiki Sholatmu Agar <br class="hidden sm:inline" /> Allah Perbaiki Hidupmu
  </h1>

  <!-- Kutipan Hadits -->
  <div class="mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 italic leading-relaxed">
      &ldquo;Sesungguhnya amal yang pertama kali dihisab pada seorang hamba pada hari kiamat adalah <strong class="font-bold text-gray-900">sholatnya</strong>. Maka, jika sholatnya baik, sungguh ia telah beruntung dan berhasil. Dan jika shalatnya rusak, sungguh ia telah gagal dan rugi.&rdquo;
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-500 italic">
      HR. At-Tirmidzi no. 413, An-Nasa'i no. 465, dishahihkan oleh Syaikh Al Albani dalam Shahih Al Jami'
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Tombol CTA -->
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
    <a
      href="/blog"
      class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-3 bg-black text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors font-medium cursor-pointer"
      aria-label="Baca Artikel dan Panduan Sholat"
    >
      <Icon name="tabler:book-2" class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true" />
      <span>Baca Panduan</span>
    </a>
    <a
      href="/about"
      class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 bg-white text-gray-900 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors font-medium cursor-pointer"
    >
      Tentang Kami
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Sumber Resmi & Terpercaya (Trust Signals) -->
  <div class="mt-14 sm:mt-18 pt-10 border-t border-gray-200/80 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-4 border border-gray-200">
      <Icon name="tabler:shield-check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-black" />
      <span>Rujukan Resmi & Terverifikasi</span>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-6 max-w-xl mx-auto">
      Setiap ayat, terjemahan, doa, dan rekaman murottal di platform ini bersumber dari otoritas keagamaan resmi dan kitab rujukan shahih.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3.5 text-left">
      <!-- 1. Kemenag RI -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200/80 shadow-xs hover:border-black/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-900 mb-2.5">
          <Icon name="tabler:book" class="w-4.5 h-4.5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">Kemenag RI</h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Mushaf Standar Indonesia & Terjemahan Resmi Kemenag
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Tafsir Kemenag -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200/80 shadow-xs hover:border-black/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-900 mb-2.5">
          <Icon name="tabler:file-text" class="w-4.5 h-4.5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">Tafsir Kemenag</h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Tafsir Wajiz & Tahlili dari pakar dan ulama Al-Quran
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Hadits Shahih -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200/80 shadow-xs hover:border-black/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-900 mb-2.5">
          <Icon name="tabler:circle-check" class="w-4.5 h-4.5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">Hadits Shahih</h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Kitab Hisnul Muslim & riwayat hadits bersanad shahih
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. EveryAyah Murottal -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200/80 shadow-xs hover:border-black/30 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-900 mb-2.5">
          <Icon name="tabler:headphones" class="w-4.5 h-4.5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">EveryAyah Audio</h3>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Murottal qari Masjidil Haram & Nabawi berkualitas jernih
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
